      "summary": "The weapons catalog holds exactly 15 unordered material-pair recipes with no duplicate pair. The route sorts each weapon's two recipe resource IDs and matches on the sorted pair across every file in content/weapons/, so [RSC-01, RSC-02] and [RSC-02, RSC-01] collide as they should and the count is of distinct pairs rather than of files. A file count alone would not catch two weapons sharing one pair.",
