      "id": "VER-DAT-003-003",
      "summary": "Each weapon's recipe resources, in authored order, have canonical letters that concatenate to its W-xy ID suffix. The route resolves each recipe resource ID to its canonical_letter in the resources catalog and compares the concatenation to the two characters after 'W-', so W-AB must resolve to the resources lettered A and B. This is the compensation for a recipe that is no longer human-legible: without it a mis-assigned pair reads as valid.",
