      "summary": "A stat track's unit is a token from a closed eight-token enum rather than a free string, matched by exact case-sensitive comparison. This is the one place in the tree where a unit is carried as a value rather than as a name suffix, because rank_zero and increment_per_rank are a generic pair whose unit varies per row; the enum is what keeps that from becoming a free-text field.",
