      "summary": "FORMULA-01, the weapon stat price curve, is a registered formula kind plus parameters and never a script string. The route is a formula_kind token plus a typed parameter object; the fixture carrying formula: '5n(n + 1)' is rejected as an unknown field, because no field in the schema accepts an expression. Whether the kind has a registered descriptor is DAT-004's check.",
