      "id": "VER-DAT-003-011",
      "summary": "A branch adds no fourth stat track. The route is structural and not a rule: the branch field table declares no field by which a branch could add one, so a document carrying adds_stat_track or ore_upgradeable_stats is rejected as an unknown field at the root. What the route does not cover is a branch whose effects parameters change a quantity that is not one of the parent weapon's three tracks without naming it as a track; effects is a registry-owned parameter map, so its keys are the behavior descriptor's to constrain and not this schema's.",
